WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:47.750
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.750
Lord Krishna had clarified

3
00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:54.000
that even if the yogi's spiritual
 journey remains incomplete,

4
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.791
still they will face no loss.

5
00:00:56.791 --> 00:01:00.625
Neither in this birth nor in the next birth.

6
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:02.666
Now here, Lord Krishna is describing

7
00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:06.458
the condition of such a yogi in the next birth.

8
00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:12.333
In the previous verse,

9
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:15.750
Lord Krishna calmed Arjuna's fear

10
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:18.625
and explained that the yogi whose spiritual

11
00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:21.000
journey remained incomplete

12
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.041
faces no loss,

13
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:26.250
their good deeds protect them from downfall.

14
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.458
Whether it's about this birth

15
00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:30.458
or the next birth.

16
00:01:30.458 --> 00:01:31.375
Now here

17
00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:35.000
in the forty-first verse, 
Lord Krishna further explains:

18
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.000
If someone even in this life,

19
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.875
leaves the path of yoga incomplete,

20
00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:41.625
still every effort

21
00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:45.291
of yoga done by them is a deed of merit.

22
00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:46.958
And because of this very merit,

23
00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:48.083
after death,

24
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:50.750
such yogis rise up.

25
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.666
They go to divine worlds

26
00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:55.250
where they receive the fruit of this merit,

27
00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.250
and they remain there for a long time.

28
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.958
In these worlds like heaven, the yogi

29
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:02.916
because of their good deeds

30
00:02:02.916 --> 00:02:06.416
spends time with joy and peace.

31
00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:09.916
And this journey remains pleasant ahead too.

32
00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:12.458
After spending time in these divine worlds,

33
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:15.375
when the yogi comes again to this mortal world,

34
00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:18.708
their birth also happens in such a family

35
00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:21.541
where spirituality can get encouragement.

36
00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:24.125
Lord Krishna says that such a yogi

37
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:26.833
can be born in two types of families –

38
00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:28.791
one, religious family,

39
00:02:28.791 --> 00:02:32.458
second, in wealthy and prosperous family.

40
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:35.000
In religious families, that yogi gets opportunity

41
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.083
to live spiritual life again.

42
00:02:38.083 --> 00:02:39.875
In prosperous families too,

43
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:43.500
there's no worry about basic necessities of life.

44
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.333
For this very reason, the yogi,
 even in such a birth, without any obstacle.

45
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.708
can focus their attention on spiritual progress.

46
00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:53.791
Meaning, the spiritual efforts
 of the previous birth

47
00:02:53.791 --> 00:02:57.958
don't go to waste, but opportunity
 is also received in the next birth

48
00:02:57.958 --> 00:03:00.166
to complete those efforts.

49
00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:01.916
And then in the forty-second verse,

50
00:03:01.916 --> 00:03:03.625
Lord Krishna says:

51
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:07.458
If the yogi has made more
 progress on the path of yoga,

52
00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:09.166
then that person gets birth in the home of yogis.

53
00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:11.458
then that person gets birth in the home of yogis.

54
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:13.250
Such families are full

55
00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.291
of spiritual knowledge,

56
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:16.708
and getting birth here

57
00:03:16.708 --> 00:03:19.708
is extremely rare and auspicious.

58
00:03:19.708 --> 00:03:23.166
This accelerates the yogi’s spiritual progress 

59
00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:26.875
from the beginning in this new birth.

60
00:03:26.875 --> 00:03:29.291
The main point of both these verses is this –

61
00:03:29.291 --> 00:03:32.208
that the yoga efforts made in this birth

62
00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:34.208
won't go to waste.

63
00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:37.166
After death, the yogi will get
 the happiness of divine worlds,

64
00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:38.666
happiness of divine worlds,

65
00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:42.791
and then the next birth will
 also be in a pleasant family,

66
00:03:42.791 --> 00:03:47.875
where opportunity will be received
 to advance this spiritual journey.

67
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.083
Even if the journey of yoga remains incomplete,

68
00:03:57.083 --> 00:04:00.291
still no effort of the yogi

69
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:02.541
goes to waste.

70
00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:05.666
Even after death, their meritorious deeds

71
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.875
pave their path,

72
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:10.500
and in the next life

73
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.041
they are born in such a home

74
00:04:13.041 --> 00:04:16.833
where spiritual advancement is easy.

75
00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:21.500
This is the fruit of their previous life's practice.

76
00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.875
The person who is born in this life

77
00:04:24.875 --> 00:04:28.083
in a prosperous or religious family,

78
00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:33.083
has received all this
 according to their previous deeds.

79
00:04:33.083 --> 00:04:38.083
Therefore being jealous of others' fortune

80
00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:39.416
is useless,

81
00:04:39.416 --> 00:04:45.083
because everyone receives
 fruit according to their deeds.

82
00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:48.500
No one has snatched anything

83
00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.958
from your fortune.

84
00:04:50.958 --> 00:04:55.083
If you must think something, then think this –

85
00:04:55.083 --> 00:04:59.083
what can be done now in this life?

86
00:04:59.083 --> 00:05:02.250
Your birth was not in your hands,

87
00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.916
but how you will live life now

88
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:08.750
is completely in your hands.

89
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:12.000
So make this life positive.

90
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.958
Do good deeds, because
 their benefit will be received

91
00:05:15.958 --> 00:05:18.583
birth after birth.

92
00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:22.958
And yes, life doesn't run only on fortune.

93
00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:24.125
Many people,

94
00:05:24.125 --> 00:05:28.250
even after getting facilities, spoil their life,

95
00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:32.541
while some people, even being
 born in difficult circumstances,

96
00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:37.000
advance through their hard work.

97
00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.291
So what will you choose?

98
00:05:39.291 --> 00:05:42.083
Becoming sad thinking about fortune,

99
00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:46.625
or deciding your future through your own effort?

100
00:05:46.625 --> 00:05:49.208
Don't grieve over the past.

101
00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:52.833
For this life and for coming births,

102
00:05:52.833 --> 00:05:54.458
do good deeds.

103
00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:57.166
Walk on the path of spirituality

104
00:05:57.166 --> 00:05:59.333
and improve your future.

105
00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:04.208
All these efforts will always remain with you.

106
00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.708
If you are born in a religious or

107
00:06:10.708 --> 00:06:13.541
prosperous family,

108
00:06:13.541 --> 00:06:16.750
then understanding this as
 reward for deeds of previous birth,

109
00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:21.083
don't just drown in pride –

110
00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:23.333
your fortune is good,

111
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:26.625
but being born in such a home

112
00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:29.916
is also a very big responsibility.

113
00:06:29.916 --> 00:06:32.333
Fruit of previous merits is
 definitely being received

114
00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:34.458
in this birth,

115
00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:39.208
but only spending time in
 personal happiness and joy,

116
00:06:39.208 --> 00:06:42.458
don't waste this opportunity.

117
00:06:42.458 --> 00:06:46.375
You've got opportunity once again

118
00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:49.208
to advance your spiritual progress.

119
00:06:49.208 --> 00:06:52.375
Understand this with this example –

120
00:06:52.375 --> 00:06:55.625
if someone gets a lot of wealth,

121
00:06:55.625 --> 00:06:56.916
and that person,

122
00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:59.750
instead of increasing that wealth,

123
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.666
only and only keeps spending that wealth?

124
00:07:03.666 --> 00:07:06.125
Then is this right?

125
00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:08.916
No! Because if it remains like this,

126
00:07:08.916 --> 00:07:13.208
one day they will become poor.

127
00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:16.458
If your birth has happened in a good home,

128
00:07:16.458 --> 00:07:19.833
then it's like spiritual wealth.

129
00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:22.958
Increase this wealth.

130
00:07:22.958 --> 00:07:24.333
Don't waste it by being absorbed

131
00:07:24.333 --> 00:07:28.708
only in materialism and luxury.

132
00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:32.666
The prosperity and means
 you've received from birth,

133
00:07:32.666 --> 00:07:35.458
use them in the right direction.

134
00:07:35.458 --> 00:07:38.000
Use in religious works,

135
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.250
use in helping others,

136
00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.791
use in your spiritual development.

137
00:07:43.791 --> 00:07:47.125
And this matter is for everyone.

138
00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:51.541
Wherever the birth happened,
 that's not important.

139
00:07:51.541 --> 00:07:53.791
Important is this –

140
00:07:53.791 --> 00:07:57.916
how you handled that life now,

141
00:07:57.916 --> 00:08:01.666
how you improved it, 
how you made that life useful

142
00:08:01.666 --> 00:08:05.833
for yourself and for others.

143
00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.625
In life, everyone

144
00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:15.083
starts their spiritual journey

145
00:08:15.083 --> 00:08:18.500
from different places.

146
00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.583
Some, as a result

147
00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:21.166
of deeds of previous birth,

148
00:08:21.166 --> 00:08:25.416
get such a family in this birth

149
00:08:25.416 --> 00:08:28.666
where there's atmosphere of spirituality.

150
00:08:28.666 --> 00:08:32.916
On the other hand, some
 people don't get such atmosphere,

151
00:08:32.916 --> 00:08:35.416
so their spiritual progress

152
00:08:35.416 --> 00:08:41.208
may take some more time and efforts.

153
00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:43.958
Everyone got different birth,

154
00:08:43.958 --> 00:08:47.625
but you don't have control over this,

155
00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:51.333
nor is being distressed by this appropriate.

156
00:08:51.333 --> 00:08:53.541
Whatever opportunity you got,

157
00:08:53.541 --> 00:08:56.958
the beginning of progress 
must be done from there,

158
00:08:56.958 --> 00:09:01.333
so that this life and the next birth are pleasant.

159
00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:05.708
And this very thinking will be appropriate
 in professional settings too.

160
00:09:05.708 --> 00:09:09.291
A person many times compares with others

161
00:09:09.291 --> 00:09:11.083
and becomes sad.

162
00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:17.000
Comparison of position, comparison of salary,
 comparison of opportunities given to others.

163
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:21.125
All this comparison is useless.

164
00:09:21.125 --> 00:09:23.750
Because whatever opportunity you got,

165
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.041
professional progress

166
00:09:25.041 --> 00:09:28.375
you must start from there.

167
00:09:28.375 --> 00:09:31.208
Coming under jealousy, don't think

168
00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:35.000
that others got something without hard work.

169
00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.916
You neither know their life completely,

170
00:09:38.916 --> 00:09:40.500
nor their personality,

171
00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:42.750
and neither their present

172
00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:45.958
and previous birth's deeds.

173
00:09:45.958 --> 00:09:49.458
What's appropriate is this –
 that you abandon despair

174
00:09:49.458 --> 00:09:53.125
and keep this firm resolve that you will change

175
00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:57.750
your present and future
 with hard work and dedication.

176
00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.958
The past has passed,

177
00:09:59.958 --> 00:10:03.416
it cannot determine your success.

178
00:10:03.416 --> 00:10:05.916
Only your dedication

179
00:10:05.916 --> 00:10:10.375
and positive thinking will now be useful ahead.

180
00:10:10.375 --> 00:10:15.208
So just take your next step with positivity,

181
00:10:15.208 --> 00:10:19.833
and keep moving forward step by step.
